{"id":"n90301-1-7","stage":5,"title":"야광 · 夜光","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90301-1-7-1","ko":"내 시계는 야광 시계야.","zh":"我的手表是夜光表的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"시계는","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계는","audio":"/audio/d6fc37108aa1e46f276d.mp3"}},{"text":"야광","meaning":"夜光","explanation":"야광：夜光","readings":[{"term":"야광","audio":"/audio/73ecdedd956c65219da0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90301","senseId":"1","lemma":"야광","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야광","audio":"/audio/73ecdedd956c65219da0.mp3"}},{"text":"시계야.","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계야","audio":"/audio/5bd7440453f947b83b72.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]},{"id":"73ecdedd956c6521","term":"야광","zh":"夜光","audio":"/audio/73ecdedd956c65219da0.mp3","entryId":"90301","definition":"在黑暗的地方发出亮光；或指那样的东西。","pronunciation":["야ː광"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed81400ba00cc92549db.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90301-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 어두울 때에도 시간을 확인할 수 있겠구나.","zh":"那样的话，即使在黑暗中也能看清时间了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"어두울","meaning":"暗，黑暗","explanation":"어둡다：暗，黑暗；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어두울","audio":"/audio/919122e64365f61aae2e.mp3"}},{"text":"때에도","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때에도","audio":"/audio/ec14fe6a552882c890e4.mp3"}},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간을","audio":"/audio/ef64a5c202c601ff5d8d.mp3"}},{"text":"확인할","meaning":"确认，得知，查看","explanation":"확인하다：确认，得知，查看；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"확인하다","audio":"/audio/895c2bcd51e10cf1d30a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73237","senseId":"1","lemma":"확인하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"확인할","audio":"/audio/4c5f5e3a92d8d28e0809.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있겠구나.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있겠구나","audio":"/audio/60a16792be1df184e7f9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"暗，黑暗","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"没有光或光线很弱而不亮。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"从某一时候到另一时候的期间。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"895c2bcd51e10cf1","term":"확인하다","zh":"确认，得知，查看","audio":"/audio/895c2bcd51e10cf1d30a.mp3","entryId":"73237","definition":"了解到或确定了确实是那样没错。","pronunciation":["화긴하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/35e9f299034dd5f68431.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.15,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90301","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"optio